# Framer Handoff

## Architecture
Framer = stakeholder-facing visual POC. Next.js = production foundation.
Do not duplicate content, tracking, or compliance ownership across both.

## Framer MCP workflow
1. Audit project structure first
2. Propose page/section map before editing
3. Modify one page or section at a time
4. Avoid broad prompts like "redesign everything"
5. Keep original template backup

## Handoff path
Framer POC → stakeholder approval → export or manual rebuild → Next.js MVP
See `docs/framer-poc-map.md` and `docs/architecture-decision.md`
